632
00:37:03.721 --> 00:37:04.555
ano?

633
00:37:06.849 --> 00:37:08.768
Dahil wala na akong ibang magagawa.

634
00:37:09.936 --> 00:37:11.562
<i>Gagawin ko ang lahat.</i>

635
00:37:11.646 --> 00:37:14.565
At ibig kong sabihin ang lahat ng ito.

636
00:37:14.649 --> 00:37:16.692
Ako ang magiging pinuno
ng fishing village,

637
00:37:16.776 --> 00:37:18.819
